ree hand-written shell blocks. The product has no primitive for \"this invocation began\", so nothing can say \"and it did not end\".\n\nRetires: the by-hand recovery of a dead or hung drive (the worktree removed, the branch reset, the events archived by a person); the screen's in-memory notion of a running drive as the only witness that one runs; silence as an outcome.\n\n## Claims\n\n- bin/attavo\n- schema/records/build.schema.json\n- schema/records/verify.schema.json\n- schema/manifest.schema.json\n- attavo.toml\n- tests/test_doctor.py\n- tests/test_drive.py\n- tests/test_ledger.py\n\n## Criteria\n\n- doctor-fails-on-an-invocation-without-record.sh: on a fixture tenant with a build-01.started marker naming a dead pid on this host and no build-01.json, attavo doctor --json fails proof no-invocation-lacks-record naming build-01, and holds once build-01.json exists\n- recover-writes-a-died-record.sh: on the same fixture, attavo drive --recover 1 writes build-01.json with status failed and stop class died, provenance product, with a log beside it, committed by the driver identity with a clean tree, after which proof five holds\n- died-and-hung-are-stop-classes.sh: both stage schemas' stop enums name died and hung, the manifest schema declares [drive].stall_after_s, and bin/attavo's STOP_CLASSES names both","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f081a203-e2ee-47b3-8bf8-5fc3aaeb804d","uuid":"d2acfca5-9219-490b-a189-6359488ca460","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:40:25.523Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"total 12128\ndrwxr-xr-x  14 davidbean  staff      448 Sep 17 13:37 .\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 davidbean  staff      192 Sep 17 13:37 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff      274 Sep 17 13:37 approval-01.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff       44 Sep 17 13:37 build-01.filed\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff     1066 Sep 17 13:37 build-01.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff  2625035 Sep 17 13:37 build-01.log\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff       44 Sep 17 13:37 